  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract PC-30452 EURONET corresponding to Specific Contract SIEA 2018 &#xbf; 20770 EURONET.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The above contract, PC-30452, ended on 31/12/2024 and the balance payment of EUR 129,706 is still due in 2025. The contract was funded under FWC SIEA 2018, which terminated on the 31/12/2023 and therefore no more funds are available. Consequently, this dummy contract is created under the LA Regional Facility to pay the amount due.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
